@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> ParsingInput : User provides input
ParsingInput --> DeterminingRequestType : NLP parses input
DeterminingRequestType --> SchedulingMeeting : If meeting request
DeterminingRequestType --> AddingTask : If task request
SchedulingMeeting --> SettingReminders : Schedule meeting
SettingReminders --> Idle : Return to idle
AddingTask --> CreatingTasks : Add relevant tasks
CreatingTasks --> Idle : Return to idle
Idle --> ViewingCalendar : User requests calendar view
ViewingCalendar --> Idle : Return to idle
Idle --> [*] : Exit feature
@enduml
